        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/7ba0ec/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-14T01:38:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey guys,</p><p>Just an update from my end (I haven't heard from G&gt;G since January). Things exploded for both of our business lives so I've pushed off proposing until later in the year when things will be more settled (the relationship is still rock solid though). Big move coming up and everything. I'm sure G&gt;G has been busy as all hell too- I'm hoping to get more in touch with them over the summer if they're still willing to help. Thank you all for the good wishes!</p>",
